        "precision": "exact"
      },
      "claim_text": "Finally, we show how the data can be linked to 700 579 housing listings from FINN.no, where 38 percent of listings mention cycling, and propose models for future analysis.",
      "assessment": "no",
      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "Section 6.1 and Appendix A describe the share of all listings (nationwide, 2020-2026) that mention cycling, which is not tied to any opening. Section 6.1 states 'We have not yet linked the listings to the database.' Equation (2) is only a proposed specification and Section 8 lists the linkage as a remaining step. The abstract's 'show how ... can be linked' therefore describes an unperformed step and no demonstration or linkage procedure is reported.",
