      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "Figure 1 counts 'Distinct openings that took place 2' and calls Tromsø Bridge and Grettefoss Bridge 'planned'. Table 2 footnote c, added later, says Grettefoss was 'Confirmed to have opened 3 November as planned', before the manuscript date of 9 November. The abstract and Figure 1 therefore appear not updated for this. The article was coded 'unclear' at publication, which may justify the count of two, but the abstract does not say the two are those that had occurred when the pilot sample was drawn. The conclusion that search is noisy is robust to this (3 of 70 would still be very low).",
